  "memo": "Elegant Water Gum is a cultivar distinctive for its larger foliage and reddish new growth. This evergreen tree forms a slender, upright trunk with attractively-peeling bark in shades of white, brown, and orange. Its deep green leaves are glossy and aromatic when crushed. A flurry of fragrant, yellow flowers blanket the canopy in spring and summer, attracting bees for pollination. This species can be pruned into a multi-trunked or rounded shape. It  best suited to cultivation in temperate, coastal sites.",
